an>-子结构</li>\n<li>子结构还必须逐项继承常量、函数和关系解释，不能只要求论域包含</li>\n<li>两个论域均由相应结构投影得到，不再把游离的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span>当作隐含参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}, \\mathfrak{B}$ (candidate $S$-structures, see [[88-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n,\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n$ (signature components, see [[88-df-structure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}, \\mathfrak{B}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n,\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_S(\\mathfrak{B},\\mathfrak{A})","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substructure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S(\\mathfrak{B},\\mathfrak{A})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{B})\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{A})\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(c^{\\mathfrak{B}}=c^{\\mathfrak{A}})\n\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\n\\bigl(f^{\\mathfrak{B}}=f^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\!\\upharpoonright\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak B)^n\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n\\bigl(R^{\\mathfrak{B}}=R^{\\mathfrak{A}}\\cap\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak